Rules:
- Only report findings you are confident about (confidence >= 0.6)
- Severity: critical, high, medium, low, info
- Evidence must be a direct quote from the output
- If no findings, return empty findings array
- new_subdomains must be valid FQDNs only
- Do not invent data not present in the output
